hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1758","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aadmi ne kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Kaafir Qiyaamat key din apne chehrey par kaisey haanka jaaeyga? Aap ne farmaya: Kya wo jo use duniya mein donon pairon par chalaata tha us par qaadir nahi hai ke use Qiyaamat key din uskey chehrey par chalaaey? (Bukhari: 4760). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Alif Laam Meem. Room maghloob ho gaey)."
